            "review_text": "Hiền\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nCozy place\nMar 2023 • Couples\nWhenever I crave for a croissant, absolutely Tartine won't disappoint me. Look at the honey comb inside, the texture was really amazing. It’s a tiny store located in hidden alley of An Phu\nWritten March 23, 2023\nOwner's R\nThanks a lot for your visit and kind words. loads of butter and passion comes into our sourdough croissants, pains au choco and cruffins ;-) \n\nHave a lovey day and see you soon here or at another of our locations. \n______\nTᴀʀᴛɪɴᴇ Sᴀɪ̈ɢᴏɴ, sᴏᴜʀᴅᴏᴜɢʜ ʙᴀᴋᴇʀʏ-ᴄᴀғᴇ́-ʀᴇsᴛᴀᴜʀᴀɴᴛs ɪɴ sᴜɴɴʏ Sᴀɪ̈ɢᴏɴ:\n📍Tartine Saïgon 25 Nguyen Dinh Chieu, Q1\n📍Tartine Saïgon 215 Ly Tu Trong, Q1\n📍Tartine Saïgon Binh Thanh\n📍Tartine Saïgon Thao Dien\n📍Tartine Saïgon An Phu\n📍Tartine Saïgon Vista Verde\n📍Tartine Saïgon PMH Mỹ Khang \n📍Tartine Saïgon PMH Mỹ Hoàng (opening on 30th of March)\n⏰ 7am-10pm, every day for dine-in & takeaway, and baking twice a day\n🍺🍹🍷🥃Happy Hour Every Day 3-7pm #Buy1Get1Free\n🛵 Order for fast delivery or pick up\n__________\n🥐🍳🥐🍳🥐\nYou can also find our breads and goodies at our partner shops\nRead more\nWritten March 26, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
