            "review_text": "Karin M\nMuscat, Oman247 contributions\n0\nYummy\nMar 2023 • Solo\nOnly reason I did not give this place full marks the service is slow and you have to get a waiters attention to come serve you.\n\nThe food is excellent. I had the eggs Benedict, kombucha and a kefir smoothie. \n\nLaid back atmosphere and I would love to come back.\nRead more\nWritten March 23, 2023\nOwner's R\nDear Karim - Thanks a lot for your visit and feedback. We loved to hear you enjoy our food, and took advantage of your comment to resume a training of our team. Kefir is homemade of course :-) Have a lovely day and see you again soon!\n______\nTᴀʀᴛɪɴᴇ Sᴀɪ̈ɢᴏɴ, sᴏᴜʀᴅᴏᴜɢʜ ʙᴀᴋᴇʀʏ-ᴄᴀғᴇ́-ʀᴇsᴛᴀᴜʀᴀɴᴛs ɪɴ sᴜɴɴʏ Sᴀɪ̈ɢᴏɴ:\n📍Tartine Saïgon 25 Nguyen Dinh Chieu, Q1\n📍Tartine Saïgon 215 Ly Tu Trong, Q1\n📍Tartine Saïgon Binh Thanh\n📍Tartine Saïgon Thao Dien\n📍Tartine Saïgon An Phu\n📍Tartine Saïgon Vista Verde\n📍Tartine Saïgon PMH Mỹ Khang \n📍Tartine Saïgon PMH Mỹ Hoàng (opening 30 March)\n⏰ 7am-10pm, every day for dine-in & takeaway, and baking twice a day\n🍺🍹🍷🥃Happy Hour Every Day 3-7pm #Buy1Get1Free\n🛵 Order for fast delivery or pick up\n__________\n🥐🍳🥐🍳🥐\nYou can also find our breads and goodies at our partner shops\nRead more\nWritten March 26, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
