            "review_text": "NhuNgocNguyen\n5 contributions\n0\nPERFECTION FOR BREKKIE\nJan 2023\nComing here without any expectation. \nThis place is really interesting and surprised me a lot. They have fresh sourdough bread everyday. The food is delicious. Should have a cup of coffee then you're ready for working. The atsmophere and space make me comfortable. The staff is really helpful . \n\nSuitable for any kind of repast. They serve from 7am-10pm <3\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 2, 2023\nOwner's R\nSo glad you found us and liked it. Many thanks, Miss. Greetings from the team here!\n\nThanks for your visit. Great you liked it!\n\n______\nTᴀʀᴛɪɴᴇ Sᴀɪ̈ɢᴏɴ, sᴏᴜʀᴅᴏᴜɢʜ ʙᴀᴋᴇʀʏ-ᴄᴀғᴇ́-ʀᴇsᴛᴀᴜʀᴀɴᴛs ɪɴ sᴜɴɴʏ Sᴀɪ̈ɢᴏɴ:\n📍Tartine Saïgon 25 Nguyen Dinh Chieu, Q1\n📍Tartine Saïgon 215 Ly Tu Trong, Q1\n📍Tartine Saïgon Binh Thanh\n📍Tartine Saïgon Thao Dien\n📍Tartine Saïgon An Phu\n📍Tartine Saïgon Vista Verde\n📍Tartine Saïgon PMH Mỹ Khang \n⏰ 7am-10pm, every day for dine-in & takeaway, and baking twice a day\n🍺🍹🍷🥃Happy Hour Every Day 3-7pm #Buy1Get1Free\n🛵 Order for fast delivery or pick up\n__________\n🥐🍳🥐🍳🥐\nYou can also find our breads and goodies at our partner shops\nRead more\nWritten February 20, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
