            "review_text": "Soko37\nBudapest, Hungary20962 contributions\n14\nBakery 🥯 and coffee ☕️ shop\nJan 2021 • Solo\nPeople come in the morning to get their freshly baked breads, on feet 🦶 or bicycles 🚲 or motorcycles 🏍. Many customers come from neighbouring big compounds. Some of people to stay having breakfast 🍳 or coffee ☕️. You chose from different types of bread 🥖 and drinks 🥤. Nice 👍 ambience of open cafe under the roof. Bread 🍞 is good sourdough one\nRead more\nWritten February 2, 2021\nOwner's R\nhello Soko - thanks for your visit and review. See you again soon! \n\nKind regards,\nTartine Saigon's team of passionate bakers\n____\nSᴏᴜʀᴅᴏᴜɢʜ ʙᴀᴋᴇʀʏ-ᴄᴀғᴇ́s-ʀᴇsᴛᴀᴜʀᴀɴᴛs ɪɴ sᴜɴɴʏ Sᴀɪ̈ɢᴏɴ:\n📍Tartine Saïgon 25 Nguyen Dinh Chieu, Q1\n📍Tartine Saïgon 215 Ly Tu Trong, Q1\n📍Tartine Saïgon Binh Thanh\n📍Tartine Saïgon Thao Dien\n📍Tartine Saïgon An Phu\n📍Tartine Saïgon Vista Verde\nRead more\nWritten June 16, 2022\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
